###  http://example.org/boris/climbing#Climber
<http://example.org/boris/climbing#Climber> rdfs:subClassOf <http://outdoor-sports.org/ontology#Athlete> .


###  http://example.org/boris/climbing#ClimbingEquipment
<http://example.org/boris/climbing#ClimbingEquipment> owl:equivalentClass <http://outdoor-sports.org/ontology#Gear> .


